<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Unit 1 Review Lab</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

  :root{
    --board: #1F3A34;
    --board-dark: #172E29;
    --paper: #F6F1E4;
    --paper-line: #E4DCC6;
    --ink: #20242C;
    --chalk-yellow: #F4D35E;
    --chalk-pink: #F2789F;
    --chalk-blue: #7FC1D9;
    --chalk-white: #F5F1E8;
    --good: #4EAE8C;
    --bad: #E0644F;
    --shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: var(--board);
    color: var(--chalk-white);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  body {
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0, transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0, transparent 40%);
  }

  h1, h2, h3, .hand {
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  #app { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 18px 60px; }

  .board-header { text-align: center; padding: 18px 0 6px; }
  .board-header h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--chalk-white);
    text-shadow: 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }
  .board-header p {
    color: var(--chalk-blue);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
  }
  .underline-scribble {
    width: 220px; height: 10px; margin: 4px auto 0;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--chalk-yellow);
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: .7;
  }

  main { display: none; }
  main.active { display: block; animation: fadein .35s ease; }
  @keyframes fadein { from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }

  /* HOME GRID */
  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .activity-card {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 var(--board-dark), 0 10px 18px var(--shadow);
    transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .activity-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 10px 0 var(--board-dark), 0 14px 22px var(--shadow); }
  .activity-card:active { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--board-dark); }
  .activity-card .icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .activity-card h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .activity-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #4B5259; }
  .activity-card .tag {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 20px; color: #fff;
  }
  .tag.quiz{ background: var(--chalk-pink); }
  .tag.sort{ background: var(--good); }
  .tag.blitz{ background: var(--bad); }
  .tag.cards{ background: #5C8CE0; }
  .tag.ph{ background: #4396B3; }
  .tag.mix{ background: #9163C7; }
  .tag.metals{ background: #C98A1F; }

  .classify-card {
    background: #fff; border: 2px solid #E9E2CD; border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 26px 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .classify-label { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .classify-emoji { font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .classify-clue { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #666; font-style: italic; }
  .cat-row { display:flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cat-row .choice-btn { flex: 1; min-width: 110px; text-align:center; font-weight: 700; }

  .back-btn {
    background: none; border: 2px solid var(--chalk-white); color: var(--chalk-white);
    padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:600; font-size:0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .back-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }

  .panel {
    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px 24px; box-shadow: 0 10px 26px var(--shadow);
  }

  .progress-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 0.85rem; color:#555; }
  .score-pill { background: var(--board); color: var(--chalk-white); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight:700; }

  /* QUIZ */
  #quiz-question { font-size: 1.35rem; line-height:1.4; margin: 6px 0 20px; }
  .choice-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .choice-btn {
    text-align: left; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #DCD5C0; border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 13px 16px; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Inter';
    color: var(--ink); transition: all .12s ease;
  }
  .choice-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--chalk-blue); background: #F0F8FB; }
  .choice-btn.correct { background: #DFF3E9; border-color: var(--good); font-weight: 700; }
  .choice-btn.incorrect { background: #FBE4E0; border-color: var(--bad); }
  .choice-btn:disabled { cursor: default; }

  .feedback { margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; display:none; }
  .feedback.show { display: block; }
  .feedback.good { background: #DFF3E9; color: #205F45; }
  .feedback.bad { background: #FBE4E0; color: #7A2E20; }

  .next-btn, .primary-btn {
    margin-top: 18px; background: var(--board); color: var(--chalk-white); border:none;
    padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 24px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; cursor:pointer;
    font-family:'Inter'; display:none;
  }
  .next-btn.show { display:inline-block; }
  .primary-btn.show { display:inline-block; }
  .next-btn:hover, .primary-btn:hover { background: var(--board-dark); }

  .end-screen { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; }
  .end-screen .hand { font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--board); }

  /* SORT */
  .bins { display:flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .bin {
    flex: 1; min-width: 140px; min-height: 130px; border-radius: 12px; border: 3px dashed #C9C0A6;
    padding: 10px; text-align:center; transition: all .15s ease;
  }
  .bin h3 { margin: 2px 0 8px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .bin.element { background: #FDF2DF; }
  .bin.compound { background: #E4F0FB; }
  .bin.mixture { background: #EAF6EE; }
  .bin.target-hover { border-style: solid; transform: scale(1.02); }
  .bin-items { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; justify-content:center; min-height: 30px; }
  .bin-chip { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); border-radius: 8px; padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 0.75rem; }

  .item-tray { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content:center; margin-top: 6px; }
  .sort-item {
    background: #fff; border: 2px solid #DCD5C0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 0.92rem; cursor: pointer; font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:600;
  }
  .sort-item.selected { border-color: var(--chalk-pink); background: #FCEBF1; }
  .sort-item.placed { display:none; }

  .hint-text { font-size:0.85rem; color:#666; text-align:center; margin-top: 4px;}

  /* BLITZ */
  .blitz-bar-wrap { background:#E5DEC9; border-radius: 20px; height: 10px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom: 20px;}
  .blitz-bar { background: var(--chalk-pink); height:100%; width:100%; transition: width .1s linear; }
  #blitz-statement { font-size: 1.4rem; text-align:center; margin: 18px 0 26px; line-height:1.4; min-height: 90px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;}
  .tf-buttons { display:flex; gap: 14px; justify-content:center; }
  .tf-btn {
    flex:1; max-width: 200px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 12px; border: none; font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight:800; cursor:pointer; font-family:'Inter'; color:#fff;
  }
  .tf-btn.true-btn { background: var(--good); }
  .tf-btn.false-btn { background: var(--bad); }
  .tf-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; }

  /* FLASHCARDS */
  .flash-wrap { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; }
  .flashcard {
    width: 100%; max-width: 480px; height: 260px; perspective: 1200px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .flashcard-inner {
    position: relative; width:100%; height:100%; transition: transform .5s; transform-style: preserve-3d;
  }
  .flashcard.flipped .flashcard-inner { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
  .flashcard-face {
    position:absolute; inset:0; backface-visibility:hidden; border-radius:16px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center; padding: 26px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  .flashcard-front { background: #fff; }
  .flashcard-front .hand { font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--board); }
  .flashcard-back { background: var(--board); color: var(--chalk-white); transform: rotateY(180deg); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height:1.45; }
  .flash-controls { display:flex; gap: 12px; align-items:center; }
  .flash-controls button {
    background: var(--paper-line); border:none; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 20px; cursor:pointer;
    font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:700; color: var(--ink);
  }
  .flash-counter { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555; margin-top: 8px; }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .board-header h1 { font-size: 2.3rem; }
    .bins { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">
  <header class="board-header">
    <h1>🧪 Unit 1 Review Lab</h1>
    <p>Matter, Properties &amp; Changes — pick a way to practice</p>
    <div class="underline-scribble"></div>
  </header>

  <main id="home-screen" class="active">
    <div class="card-grid">
      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('quiz')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#F2789F" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M17 20 Q24 10 31 20" fill="none" stroke="#F2789F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="33" r="2.2" fill="#F2789F"/></svg>
        <h2>Quiz Show</h2>
        <p>One question at a time. Answer, get instant feedback, build a streak.</p>
        <span class="tag quiz">17 questions</span>
      </button>

      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('sort')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="6" y="26" width="12" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#4EAE8C" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="18" y="18" width="12" height="22" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#4EAE8C" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="30" y="10" width="12" height="30" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#4EAE8C" stroke-width="3"/></svg>
        <h2>Sort Lab</h2>
        <p>Classify each substance as an element, compound, or mixture.</p>
        <span class="tag sort">8 items</span>
      </button>

      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('blitz')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="26" r="16" fill="none" stroke="#E0644F" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M24 16v10l7 5" stroke="#E0644F" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M18 6h12" stroke="#E0644F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <h2>True or False Blitz</h2>
        <p>Fast rounds — read the statement, answer before time runs out.</p>
        <span class="tag blitz">16 statements</span>
      </button>

      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('cards')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="7" y="12" width="26" height="20" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="#5C8CE0" stroke-width="3" transform="rotate(-6 20 22)"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="26" height="20" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="#5C8CE0" stroke-width="3"/></svg>
        <h2>Flashcards</h2>
        <p>Flip through key vocabulary — atoms, changes, alloys, pH, and more.</p>
        <span class="tag cards">18 terms</span>
      </button>

      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('ph')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 6c-7 8-11 14-11 19a11 11 0 0 0 22 0c0-5-4-11-11-19z" fill="none" stroke="#7FC1D9" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M17 27h14" stroke="#7FC1D9" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <h2>pH Detective</h2>
        <p>Read the example — is it an acid or a base?</p>
        <span class="tag ph">16 examples</span>
      </button>

      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('mix')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="16" cy="18" r="8" fill="none" stroke="#B08CE0" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="30" cy="16" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#B08CE0" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="24" cy="32" r="7" fill="none" stroke="#B08CE0" stroke-width="3"/></svg>
        <h2>Mix It Up</h2>
        <p>Solution, colloid, or suspension — you decide.</p>
        <span class="tag mix">15 examples</span>
      </button>

      <button class="activity-card" onclick="goTo('metals')">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="4" fill="#E8A93B"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="24" rx="19" ry="8" fill="none" stroke="#E8A93B" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="24" rx="19" ry="8" fill="none" stroke="#E8A93B" stroke-width="3" transform="rotate(60 24 24)"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="24" rx="19" ry="8" fill="none" stroke="#E8A93B" stroke-width="3" transform="rotate(120 24 24)"/></svg>
        <h2>Metal Match</h2>
        <p>Metal, nonmetal, or metalloid? Classify each element.</p>
        <span class="tag metals">17 examples</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- QUIZ SHOW -->
  <main id="quiz-screen">
    <button class="back-btn" onclick="goTo('home')">← Back</button>
    <div class="panel">
      <div id="quiz-live">
        <div class="progress-row">
          <span id="quiz-progress">Question 1 of 17</span>
          <span class="score-pill" id="quiz-score">Score: 0</span>
        </div>
        <h3 id="quiz-question"></h3>
        <div class="choice-list" id="quiz-choices"></div>
        <div class="feedback" id="quiz-feedback"></div>
        <button class="next-btn" id="quiz-next" onclick="nextQuizQuestion()">Next question →</button>
      </div>
      <div id="quiz-end" class="end-screen" style="display:none">
        <div class="hand" id="quiz-end-title">Nice work!</div>
        <p id="quiz-end-text"></p>
        <button class="primary-btn show" onclick="startQuiz()">Play again</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- SORT LAB -->
  <main id="sort-screen">
    <button class="back-btn" onclick="goTo('home')">← Back</button>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="progress-row">
        <span>Tap a substance, then tap the bin it belongs in.</span>
        <span class="score-pill" id="sort-score">0 / 8</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bins">
        <div class="bin element" data-bin="Element"><h3>Element</h3><div class="bin-items" id="bin-element"></div></div>
        <div class="bin compound" data-bin="Compound"><h3>Compound</h3><div class="bin-items" id="bin-compound"></div></div>
        <div class="bin mixture" data-bin="Mixture"><h3>Mixture</h3><div class="bin-items" id="bin-mixture"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="item-tray" id="sort-tray"></div>
      <p class="hint-text" id="sort-hint">&nbsp;</p>
      <div style="text-align:center">
        <button class="primary-btn" id="sort-reset" onclick="startSort()">Reset lab</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- BLITZ -->
  <main id="blitz-screen">
    <button class="back-btn" onclick="goTo('home')">← Back</button>
    <div class="panel">
      <div id="blitz-live">
        <div class="progress-row">
          <span id="blitz-progress">Statement 1 of 16</span>
          <span class="score-pill" id="blitz-score">Score: 0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="blitz-bar-wrap"><div class="blitz-bar" id="blitz-bar"></div></div>
        <div id="blitz-statement"></div>
        <div class="tf-buttons">
          <button class="tf-btn true-btn" onclick="answerBlitz(true)">TRUE</button>
          <button class="tf-btn false-btn" onclick="answerBlitz(false)">FALSE</button>
        </div>
        <div class="feedback" id="blitz-feedback"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="blitz-end" class="end-screen" style="display:none">
        <div class="hand">Round complete!</div>
        <p id="blitz-end-text"></p>
        <button class="primary-btn show" onclick="startBlitz()">Run it again</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- CLASSIFY GAMES: pH Detective / Mix It Up / Metal Match -->
  <main id="classify-screen">
    <button class="back-btn" onclick="goTo('home')">← Back</button>
    <div class="panel">
      <div id="classify-live">
        <div class="progress-row">
          <span id="classify-progress">Item 1 of 16</span>
          <span class="score-pill" id="classify-score">Score: 0</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="classify-title" style="margin-top:0"></h2>
        <div class="classify-card">
          <div class="classify-emoji" id="classify-item-emoji"></div>
          <div class="classify-label" id="classify-item-label"></div>
          <div class="classify-clue" id="classify-item-clue"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cat-row" id="classify-cat-row"></div>
        <div class="feedback" id="classify-feedback"></div>
        <button class="next-btn" id="classify-next" onclick="nextClassifyItem()">Next →</button>
      </div>
      <div id="classify-end" class="end-screen" style="display:none">
        <div class="hand" id="classify-end-title">Nice work!</div>
        <p id="classify-end-text"></p>
        <button class="primary-btn show" onclick="startClassify(currentGameKey)">Play again</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- FLASHCARDS -->
  <main id="cards-screen">
    <button class="back-btn" onclick="goTo('home')">← Back</button>
    <div class="panel flash-wrap">
      <div class="flashcard" id="flashcard" onclick="flipCard()">
        <div class="flashcard-inner">
          <div class="flashcard-face flashcard-front"><span class="hand" id="flash-term"></span></div>
          <div class="flashcard-face flashcard-back"><span id="flash-def"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flash-controls">
        <button onclick="prevCard()">← Prev</button>
        <button onclick="shuffleCards()">🔀 Shuffle</button>
        <button onclick="nextCard()">Next →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="flash-counter" id="flash-counter"></div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>

<script>
/* ---------- NAVIGATION ---------- */
const classifyGameKeys = ['ph', 'mix', 'metals'];

function goTo(screen){
  document.querySelectorAll('main').forEach(m => m.classList.remove('active'));
  const isClassify = classifyGameKeys.includes(screen);
  document.getElementById(screen === 'home' ? 'home-screen' : (isClassify ? 'classify-screen' : screen + '-screen')).classList.add('active');
  if(screen === 'quiz') startQuiz();
  if(screen === 'sort') startSort();
  if(screen === 'blitz') startBlitz();
  if(screen === 'cards') startCards();
  if(isClassify) startClassify(screen);
  window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'smooth'});
}

function shuffle(arr){
  const a = arr.slice();
  for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){
    const j = Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));
    [a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]];
  }
  return a;
}

/* ---------- QUIZ SHOW ---------- */
const quizBank = [
  {q:"To be classified as \"matter,\" a substance must meet which two requirements?", a:["Have mass and take up space (volume)","Be visible and have a solid shape","Conduct heat and electricity","Be a pure element on the periodic table"], correct:0},
  {q:"A scientist measures the temperature at which a sample of gallium melts into a liquid. This is an example of observing a...", a:["Physical property, without changing the element's makeup","Chemical property, by forming a new substance","Density change caused by a reaction","Nuclear property of the element"], correct:0},
  {q:"Which of these substances is NOT an element found on the periodic table?", a:["Gold","Table Salt","Iron","Oxygen"], correct:1},
  {q:"Liquid A has a pH of 2, and Liquid B has a pH of 5. Which statement is correct?", a:["Liquid A is more acidic than Liquid B","Liquid B is more acidic than Liquid A","Both liquids are basic","Liquid A is a base and Liquid B is an acid"], correct:0},
  {q:"Looking at this pH table — Bleach: 13, Soap: 10, Milk: 6, Lemon Juice: 2 — which item is the strongest BASE?", a:["Soap","Milk","Bleach","Lemon Juice"], correct:2},
  {q:"A 1 cm³ cube of gold feels much heavier than a 1 cm³ cube of aluminum because gold has...", a:["A higher density","More malleability","A larger volume","Better conductivity"], correct:0},
  {q:"An engineer hammers a block of copper into a flat, thin sheet without it cracking. This shows that copper is...", a:["Ductile","Malleable","An insulator","An alloy"], correct:1},
  {q:"The engineer pulls aluminum through a machine to stretch it into long, thin electrical wires. This shows that aluminum is...", a:["Malleable","Brittle","Ductile","A metalloid"], correct:2},
  {q:"To make a stronger, rust-resistant material, the engineer melts copper and tin together to form bronze. Bronze is a type of...", a:["Compound","Alloy","Element","Acid"], correct:1},
  {q:"Which is a typical property of a non-metal?", a:["High electrical conductivity","Shiny, metallic luster","Poor conductor of heat","Highly ductile"], correct:2},
  {q:"What makes metalloids unique compared to metals and non-metals?", a:["They cannot react with other elements","They are always gases at room temperature","They have properties of both metals and non-metals","They are the only substances with mass"], correct:2},
  {q:"If you mix salt and pepper together in a bowl, why is this a mixture and not a compound?", a:["They can be physically separated and are not chemically bonded","They are both solids","A brand-new substance was formed","The salt dissolves the pepper"], correct:0},
  {q:"A white solid sample can be separated by dissolving it in water and then evaporating the water. This sample is most likely a...", a:["Compound","Element","Mixture","Acid"], correct:2},
